OL,3,GNEWSAHotel demolition begins as
OL,4,Aasbestos removed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe demolition of a derelict hotel has
OL,7,Fbegun after about 470 tonnes of
OL,8,Fasbestos were removed.
OL,10,FThe dilapidated Golden Eagle hotel in
OL,11,FThornaby, on Teesside, has been empty
OL,12,Ffor several years and subjected to
OL,13,Farson and vandalism attacks.
OL,15,FSmall excavator machines have started
OL,16,Fto take down the roof and top floors of
OL,17,Fthe six-storey building, before plans
OL,18,Fto move on to the lower floors,
OL,19,FStockton Council said.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
