OL,3,GNEWSAHotel demolition begins as
OL,4,Aasbestos removed
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor leader Lisa Evans said the
OL,7,Fstructure had become an eyesore, saying
OL,8,Fthe work marked an "important milestone
OL,9,Ffor Thornaby". The demolition is
OL,10,Fexpected to be complete in the autumn.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
